{"id":3209,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>春回大地，万物竞发。在第116个“三八”国际劳动妇女节来临之际，为致敬全体女教职工的辛勤付出，3月6日，计算机科学与技术学院工会组织女教职工开展“拥抱春日 莓好同行”草莓采摘活动，以一场贴近自然的温馨之旅，为女教职工送上节日关怀。</p><p>大家在忙碌工作之余走进田园，放松身心。穿梭于草莓垄间，亲手采摘鲜红饱满的果实，欢声笑语与自然清香交织，既体验了农趣之乐，更感受到学院对女教职工的重视与温暖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XLm6/2L4QfLmlsLK7lPLmffn7-DL4vOsL4NinR-8MRT2MN70gihFp2hmCIa0MSh2okhVL1hkMmv8M8-iLRVRM8MfU8UbLzCDnzn7nRMVLNQFL8Uboz62oRnFLlWRo7lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0LzGbLmLJqdxnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=10923&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5F8E2B6747B501C7CACD9166E4DD3E2F/3D997F84/1BC8E\" vheight=\"389\" vwidth=\"378\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XMz9/iL4vanmr7LK4L4nznkU8nRMRUOYozUiM8-8MlCZLzC0gihFp2hmCIa0okyanky8UYy8UmGZU8UPM7M7M47iUzWknRWRUlL4Mz98LNMFL4n2nRGbMzMFo7Q2L7CJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0LzGbLmLJqdxnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=10923&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XU4N/Poz67UzLYUK4CDnz74nz-YL4-OanRfVnm-bLR7DM4v0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhfMYy4okybLmLPLm7inNCDnRT7olnVLzT7LzGZLmVfLzfFoz-bolMfMlMFMmNPoR7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0LzGbLmLJqdxnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=10923&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0A7389231215FF6D9D9DE19D10821A10/9299CA5C/69181\" vheight=\"284\" vwidth=\"378\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XU4N/Poz67UzLYUK4CDnz74nz-YL4-OanRfVnm-bLR7DM4v0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhfMYy4okybLmLPLm7inNCDnRT7olnVLzT7LzGZLmVfLzfFoz-bolMfMlMFMmNPoR7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0LzGbLmLJqdxnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=10923&e=.png\"></p><p>此次草莓采摘活动是学院关爱女教职工的暖心举措之一，旨在通过轻松的形式缓解工作压力，增强团队凝聚力，激励广大女教职工以更饱满的热情投身教育事业。未来，学院将持续关注教职工需求，营造更有温度的育人环境。</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=XLm6/2L4QfLmlsLK7lPLmffn7-DL4vOsL4NinR-8MRT2MN70gihFp2hmCIa0MSh2okhVL1hkMmv8M8-iLRVRM8MfU8UbLzCDnzn7nRMVLNQFL8Uboz62oRnFLlWRo7lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aLzC0LzGbLmLJqdxnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1016&nid=10923&e=.png"}